    "body": "I think flags should have \"the\", at least as long as we're still writing English-ish algorithms at all instead of ES-style function calls.\n\nThere's no inconsistency with \"request's synchronous flag\". You pass \"the synchronous flag\" when setting the request, and then it becomes \"request's synchronous flag\". You give Fido \"the bone\" (or \"a bone\"), and then it becomes \"Fido's bone.\"\n",
